  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You gain a dreamspace, as the Dreamspace feat, save that you cannot bring any items with you when you enter or leave.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat counts as the Dreamspace feat for the purpose of meeting prerequisites. If you ever gain both the Mind sphere and the Warp sphere, you immediately replace this feat with the Dreamspace feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mind#toc79\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
